
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Gibmalwasaus Studio | Dein Style. Deine Welt.</title>
<meta name="description" content="Kreative T-Shirts, QR-Code-Shirts, Handyhüllen und personalisierte 3D-Produkte.">
<style>
:root{--bg:#10101b;--card:#1c1b2b;--white:#fff;--muted:#b9b7ca;--pink:#ff4fa3;--orange:#ff9b45;--blue:#6b7cff}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--white);font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:22px 7%;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff18}
.logo{font-size:23px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1px}
.logo span{color:var(--pink)}
nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;margin-left:24px;font-size:14px}
.hero{padding:95px 7% 85px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 40%,#6333a044,transparent 55%)}
.tag{color:#ff9cc9;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}
h1{font-size:clamp(44px,7vw,78px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-4px;margin:20px 0}
h1 span{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--pink),var(--orange));-webkit-background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.hero p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);max-width:560px}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(100deg,var(--pink),var(--orange));padding:15px 25px;border-radius:30px;color:#15121d;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;margin-top:18px}
.visual{min-height:330px;border-radius:30px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#29244c,#171725);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.shirt{width:210px;height:230px;background:linear-gradient(140deg,#f8f4ff,#c9c6dc);clip-path:polygon(25% 0,40% 8%,60% 8%,75% 0,100% 20%,84% 43%,74% 34%,74% 100%,26% 100%,26% 34%,16% 43%,0 20%);filter:drop-shadow(0 20px 20px #0008);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.shirt strong{color:#211b38;font-size:22px;transform:rotate(-5deg)}
.qr{position:absolute;right:13%;bottom:18%;width:75px;height:75px;background:repeating-conic-gradient(#111 0 25%,#fff 0 50%) 0/12px 12px;border:7px solid white;border-radius:5px}
section{padding:75px 7%}
.section-title{text-align:center;font-size:38px;margin:0 0 14px;letter-spacing:-1px}
.sub{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);margin:0 auto 40px;max-width:600px;line-height:1.6}
.steps,.products{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}
.card{background:var(--card);padding:28px;border:1px solid #ffffff12;border-radius:20px}
.number{font-size:30px;color:var(--pink);font-weight:900}
.card h3{font-size:21px;margin:15px 0 10px}
.card p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin:0}
.product-icon{font-size:42px;margin-bottom:15px}
.product-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#24213a,#191827);padding:28px;border-radius:22px;border:1px solid #ffffff15}
.product-card h3{margin:10px 0}
.product-card p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}
.banner{margin:10px 7% 75px;padding:55px 25px;text-align:center;border-radius:28px;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#7735a9,#e34b91,#f58a48)}
.banner h2{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,48px);margin:0 0 12px}
.banner p{line-height:1.6}
.banner a{display:inline-block;background:white;color:#25152d;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:30px;margin-top:12px}
footer{padding:30px 7%;border-top:1px solid #ffffff18;color:var(--muted);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:13px}
@media(max-width:750px){header{padding:18px 5%;align-items:flex-start;gap:15px;flex-direction:column}nav a{margin:0 16px 0 0}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:65px 6%}.visual{min-height:270px}section{padding:60px 6%}.steps,.products{grid-template-columns:1fr}.banner{margin:0 6% 55px}h1{letter-spacing:-2px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="logo">Gibmalwasaus<span> Studio.</span></div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#ideen">Unsere Ideen</a>
    <a href="#qr">QR-Shirts</a>
    <a href="#kontakt">Kontakt</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero">
  <div>
    <div class="tag">Kreativität ohne Grenzen</div>
    <h1>Dein Style.<br><span>Deine Welt.</span></h1>
    <p>Mehr als nur Produkte. Entdecke kreative Designs, personalisierte T-Shirts, besondere Handyhüllen und Ideen, die deinen eigenen Stil zeigen.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="#ideen">Entdecke unsere Ideen ↗</a>
  </div>
  <div class="visual">
    <div class="shirt"><strong>GIBMAL<br>WASAUS</strong></div>
    <div class="qr"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="qr">
  <h2 class="section-title">Ein Scan. Deine Welt.</h2>
  <p class="sub">Ein T-Shirt, das mehr kann: Unsere QR-Shirt-Idee verbindet deinen Style mit einer persönlichen Profilseite.</p>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="card"><div class="number">01</div><h3>Dein Profil</h3><p>Du gestaltest eine persönliche Seite und entscheidest selbst, welche Informationen sichtbar sind.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="number">02</div><h3>Dein QR-Shirt</h3><p>Dein persönlicher QR-Code kommt auf dein T-Shirt und führt zu deiner Profilseite.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="number">03</div><h3>Ein Scan genügt</h3><p>Andere scannen den Code und entdecken die Inhalte, die du freigegeben hast.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="ideen">
  <h2 class="section-title">Was wir vorhaben</h2>
  <p class="sub">Kreative Produkte und individuelle Designs – alles unter einer Marke.</p>
  <div class="products">
    <div class="product-card"><div class="product-icon">👕</div><h3>Custom T-Shirts</h3><p>Individuelle Motive, kreative Prints und QR-Code-Shirt-Konzepte.</p></div>
    <div class="product-card"><div class="product-icon">📱</div><h3>Handyhüllen</h3><p>Persönliche Designs und besondere Motive für dein Smartphone.</p></div>
    <div class="product-card"><div class="product-icon">🧩</div><h3>3D & Personalisiert</h3><p>Kreative Ideen und individuelle Produkte aus dem 3D-Druck.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="banner" id="kontakt">
  <h2>Mach deinen Style sichtbar.</h2>
  <p>Gibmalwasaus Studio – eine Marke voller Ideen.</p>
  <a href="#ideen">Unsere Ideen entdecken</a>
</div>
</main>

<footer>
  <strong>Gibmalwasaus Studio © 2026</strong>
  <span>Eine kreative Idee. Viele Möglichkeiten.</span>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
